{%- comment -%}
  KT image snippet — renders a Shopify image with responsive srcset, OR
  inlines a theme-asset SVG when the merchant hasn't uploaded their own image.

  WHY: <img>-loaded SVGs strip <clipPath> and <style> blocks (browser security
  sandboxing). The brand Kinbear SVGs (cat01–04) rely on clipPath for the
  sweater-stripe clipping. Inline <svg> rendering preserves them. See:
  homepage-redesign chat transcript Apr 2026 for the diagnosis.

  Usage:
    {% render 'kt-image',
        image: section.settings.kinbear_image,
        inline_asset_fallback: 'kinbear-blue-real.svg',
        class: 'hero-bear kt-wave',
        alt: 'Tresor the Kinbear',
        width: 420,
        height: 420,
        loading: 'lazy' %}

  Parameters:
    image                  — Shopify image object (image_picker setting). Optional.
    inline_asset_fallback  — Filename in theme/assets/ to inline if image is blank.
                             Must end in .svg for inlining; other extensions fall
                             back to {{ asset_url | img_tag }}.
    class                  — CSS class string applied to the wrapper.
    alt                    — Alt text. Required when image is set.
    width / height         — Explicit dimensions for CLS prevention.
    loading                — 'lazy' (default) or 'eager' (above-the-fold hero).
    sizes                  — Custom sizes attribute, defaults to '(min-width: 990px) 50vw, 100vw'.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign img_class = class | default: ''
  assign img_alt = alt | default: ''
  assign img_loading = loading | default: 'lazy'
  assign img_sizes = sizes | default: '(min-width: 990px) 50vw, 100vw'
  assign img_widths = '375, 550, 750, 1100, 1500, 2000'
  assign img_width = width | default: 800
  assign img_height = height | default: 800
-%}

{%- if image != blank -%}
  {%- comment -%} Merchant-uploaded image (image_picker). {%- endcomment -%}
  {{ image
    | image_url: width: 2000
    | image_tag:
        loading: img_loading,
        widths: img_widths,
        width: image.width,
        height: image.height,
        sizes: img_sizes,
        class: img_class,
        alt: img_alt
  }}
{%- elsif inline_asset_fallback != blank -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Theme-asset fallback. Render as <img>. Shopify's inline_asset_content has a
    15KB cap that the brand Kinbear SVGs blow past, so we accept the <img>-loaded
    SVG quirks (clipPath overflow on cat01 is a known issue documented in the
    chat transcript) until the brand designer ships SVGs without clipPath.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <img
    src="{{ inline_asset_fallback | asset_url }}"
    class="{{ img_class }}"
    alt="{{ img_alt | escape }}"
    loading="{{ img_loading }}"
    decoding="async"
    width="{{ img_width }}"
    height="{{ img_height }}">
{%- else -%}
  {%- comment -%} No image and no fallback — render a transparent 1x1 placeholder. {%- endcomment -%}
  <span class="kt-image-empty {{ img_class }}" aria-hidden="true"
        {% if width %}style="display:inline-block;width:{{ width }}px;{% if height %}height:{{ height }}px;{% endif %}"{% endif %}></span>
{%- endif -%}
